    [url=https://steamcommunity.com:/linkfilter/?url=https://nexusmods.com/victoria3/mods/54][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hmlendea/readme-assets/master/badges/stores/nexus.png[/img][/url] [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3844790373][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hmlendea/readme-assets/master/badges/stores/steam-workshop.png[/img][/url] [url=https://steamcommunity.com:/linkfilter/?url=https://github.com/hmlendea/standardised-country-colours/releases][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hmlendea/readme-assets/master/badges/stores/github.png[/img][/url]

[h1]Compatibility[/h1]
This mod is compatible with Victoria 3 1.15.* on all operating systems.

